### ── 등록 (POST) ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. 자산 등록 성공 → 201 + Location 헤더
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetTag": "HW-2026-0001",
  "serialNo": "5CG1234ABC",
  "category": "LAPTOP",
  "manufacturer": "LG",
  "modelName": "gram 16",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-03-02",
  "purchasePrice": 1890000,
  "warrantyEndDate": "2028-03-02",
  "location": "3층 창고"
}

### 2. 시리얼 없이 등록 (선택값 생략) → 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetTag": "HW-2026-0002",
  "category": "MONITOR",
  "manufacturer": "LG",
  "modelName": "27UP850",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-01-10",
  "purchasePrice": 550000
}

### 3. 자산번호 중복 → 409 DUPLICATE_ASSET_TAG
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetTag": "HW-2026-0001",
  "category": "MONITOR",
  "modelName": "27UP850"
}

### 4. 필수값(assetTag) 누락 → 400 INVALID_INPUT + errors 배열
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetTag": "",
  "category": "LAPTOP",
  "modelName": "gram 16"
}

### 5. 없는 분류값 → 400 INVALID_INPUT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetTag": "HW-2026-0003",
  "category": "NOTEBOOK",
  "modelName": "test"
}

### ── 단건 조회 (GET) ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### 6. 단건 조회 → 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/1

### 7. 없는 자산 조회 → 404 ASSET_NOT_FOUND
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/9999

### ── 목록 조회 (GET, 필터·페이징) ────────────────────────────────

### 8. 전체 목록 (기본 페이징) → 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets

### 9. status 필터
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets?status=IN_STOCK

### 10. category 필터
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets?category=LAPTOP

### 11. keyword 검색 (자산번호·모델명·시리얼)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets?keyword=gram

### 12. 복합 필터 + 페이징
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets?status=IN_STOCK&category=LAPTOP&keyword=gram&page=0&size=5

### ── 수정 (PUT) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 13. 자산 수정 성공 → 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetTag": "HW-2026-0001",
  "serialNo": "5CG1234ABC",
  "category": "LAPTOP",
  "manufacturer": "LG",
  "modelName": "gram 17 (수정)",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-03-02",
  "purchasePrice": 1890000,
  "location": "4층 회의실",
  "memo": "RAM 업그레이드 완료"
}

### 14. 없는 자산 수정 → 404
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetTag": "HW-9999",
  "category": "LAPTOP",
  "modelName": "없음"
}

### ── 상태 변경 (PATCH) ────────────────────────────────────────────

### 15. REPAIR 로 변경 → 200
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "REPAIR"
}

### 16. IN_STOCK 으로 복구 → 200
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_STOCK"
}

### 17. IN_USE 로 직접 변경 시도 → 409 ASSET_STATUS_CHANGE_NOT_ALLOWED
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_USE"
}

### 18. DISPOSED 처리 (폐기) → 200
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DISPOSED"
}

### ── 삭제 (DELETE) ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 19. IN_STOCK 자산 삭제 → 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/2

### 20. IN_STOCK이 아닌 자산 삭제 시도 → 409 ASSET_HAS_HISTORY
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/assets/1
